<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Sign In — SVPB TNG</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 80px auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
    h1   { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .sub { color: #555; margin-top: 0; }
    .card { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; background: #fafafa; }
    code { background: #eee; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px; }
    footer { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #999; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>SVPB TNG Admin</h1>
  <p class="sub">Silicon Valley Pipe Band · Tools Next Generation · v#(appVersion)</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Sign In</h2>
    <p>TNG uses Slack for authentication. To get a login link:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open Slack and send <em>any message</em> to the <strong>TNG</strong> bot.</li>
      <li>The bot will reply with a one-time login link valid for 10 minutes.</li>
      <li>Click the link to access the admin dashboard.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>If you do not have access, ask a band administrator to add your Slack account.</p>
  </div>

  <footer>SVPB TNG v#(appVersion)</footer>
</body>
</html>
